1 NAME Jöns /Bengtsson/
2 GIVN Jöns
2 SURN Bengtsson
2 _MARNM Rosenbielke
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1 JUL 1600
2 ADDR
3 CTRY Sweden
