1 NAME David Dach
1 SEX M
1 OCCU Inspektor
2 PLAC Krigsmanshuset
2 ADDR
1 BIRT
2 DATE BEF 1600
2 PLAC Preussen
2 ADDR
1 BURI
2 DATE 1667
2 ADDR
3 STAE Byarum
3 CTRY Jönköpings län
1 DEAT
2 DATE 18 APR 1667
2 PLAC Byarum
2 ADDR
