1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Two interesting Löfvings are living in the same household in Mariefred in 1760’s. They are Schierlotta Sophia Löfving (b. 1727, married to Johan Lindell) and Arvid Löfving (b. 1740). Due to the same rare name and s
2 CONC ame year of birth, this Arvid must be the same Arvid that is found in Nässjö as one of Israel Persson Löfving’s sons.   At the estate inventory of Beata Sophia Queckfeldt. Schierlotta Sophia Löfving’s name is at the bottom of the 
2 CONC document. Therefore, she must have been fänrik Johan Löfving’s widow.
2 CONT
2 CONT  their daughter who was named Beata Sophia (b. 28.9.1756 in Enköping).
