2 NICK Patrick Forbes 5th Laird of Corse
2 NICK Bishop of Aberdeen
1 NAME Patrick Forbes, 1st Bishop of Edinburgh
1 SEX M
1 BURI
2 PLAC Aberdeen Cathedral
2 ADDR
3 CITY Aberdeen
3 STAE Scotland
3 CTRY United Kingdom
1 BIRT
2 DATE 24 AUG 1564
2 PLAC Corse Castle
