2 CONT '''David, called ''Trail the axe'' , Baron of O'Neil, and Laird of Corse,''' m. Elizabeth, sister of Paniter (or Panter) of Newmanswells, secretary of state to to King James IV, and had:
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Patrick, Baron O'Neill and of Corse;''' m. Marjory, dau. of Lumsden, Laird of Maidler Cushnie, and had four sons and five daughters
