1 NOTE {geni:about_me} The Ochiltree Daughter: Historically, the daughter of the 2nd Lord Ochiltree is most widely documented as the wife of Sir James Douglas of Drumlanrig.
2 CONT
2 CONT The Donegore Branch: There is another Bethia (or Janet) Stewart, born later (circa 1627), who was the daughter of Reverend Andrew Stewart of Donegore. This Andrew Stewart was a descendant of the Ochiltree line. This Bethia/Janet i
2 CONC s the one who married Reverend Thomas Crawford (d. 1670).
