2 CONT ** Marjory Forbes+4
2 CONT ** Elizabeth Forbes+4 d. Dec 1570
2 CONT ** John Forbes, Master of Forbes3 d. 17 Jul 1537
2 CONT ** Margaret Forbes3
2 CONT * Children of John Forbes, 6th Lord Forbes and Elizabeth Barlow
2 CONT ** Arthur Forbes of Putachie3 d. Oct 1571
2 CONT ** Jean Forbes+1 b. b 1519, d. a 20 Nov 1554
