2 CONT
2 CONT Likpengar 18/1 1680 Lummelunda socken,Gotlands län : https://sok.riksarkivet.se/bildvisning/C0072687_00202#?c=&m=&s=&cv=201&xywh=2549%2C825%2C4010%2C2065
