2 SURN Cronhielm
2 NSFX till Vi
2 _MARNM Cronhielm af Flosta
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 14 JAN 1707
2 ADDR
3 CITY Västerås
3 CTRY Sweden
1 DEAT
2 DATE 27 JAN 1782
2 PLAC Vi
2 ADDR
3 ADR1 Borg
3 CITY Norrköping
3 CTRY Sweden
