1 NAME Carl Rikard /Stenfelt/
2 GIVN Carl Rikard
2 SURN Stenfelt
2 _MARNM Stenfelt
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 12 SEP 1736
2 PLAC Möcklehult (H)
