1 NOTE {geni:about_me}  Lady Elizabeth Keith is the daughter of George Keith, 4th Earl Marischal.2 She married Alexander Irvine, 8th of Drum, son of Alexander Irvine of Lonmay and Elizabeth Ogilvy, in 1552.1
2 CONT       From 1552, her married name became Irvine.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Lady Elizabeth Keith and Alexander Irvine, 8th of Drum 1.Alexander Irvine, 9th of Drum+2 d. c 1630 2.Robert Irvine, 1st of Moncoffer2 3.James Irvine+2 4.William Irvine2 5.John Irvine, 1st of Artamford+2 d. b 2 Mar 1636
2 CONC  6.unknown daughter Irvine+2 7.Elizabeth Irvine2 8.Margaret Irvine2
