2 CONT Robert Lumsden, 1st of Cushnie [1]
2 CONT *M, #331422, 
2 CONT *d. 1546
2 CONT *Last Edited=2 Apr 2011
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert Lumsden, 1st of Cushnie was the son of Robert Lumsden.[2] 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married, firstly, Isobel Forbes, daughter of John Forbes of Terpersie.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married, secondly, Jean Calder.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in 1546.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1509 he received a charter of Cushnie in free barony from King James IV.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT He had 17 younger children.[1]
