2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT From the Ancestry Freepage of Pomala Black on Constant Mitchell:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://freepages.genealogy.rootsweb.com/~havens5/p22137.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT Person Page 22137
2 CONT *Constant Mitchell
2 CONT *b. after 1609, 
2 CONT *d. after 1662, #22137
2 CONT *Father	 	Thomas Mitchell b. circa 1566, d. 1628
2 CONT *Mother	 	Margaret Vochin (Williams) b. circa 1568, d. circa 1620
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth*	after 1609	Constant was born after 1609 at Leyden, Holland. 
2 CONT *Birth	1614	But before in 1614 at Leyden, Holland.1 
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage	circa 1637	Constant Mitchell married John Fobes, son of Rev John Forbes and Christian Barclay, circa 1637 in Bridgewater, Plymouth, Massachusetts. The marriage of Constant to John Fobes or Forbes was her third marriage. B
2 CONC y his age I would guess that this was not a first marriage for John either. They could have been married in Duxbury MA, at least they were married before they moved to Bridgewater in 1645.2,1,3,4 
2 CONT
2 CONT Death	1659	
2 CONT *Constant died in 1659 at RI. ???????5 
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage*	circa 1660	Constant Mitchell married John Briggs circa 1660 in RI after the death of John Fobes.6,7 
2 CONT
2 CONT Death	circa 1661	
2 CONT *Constant died circa 1661 at Bridgewater, at Plymouth colony, at Massachusetts.4 
2 CONT *research*	1661	Find at Internet 1661 Several dates are given in various places. Likley in RI as Briggs.
2 CONT *Did she really marry four times? Twice before Fobes and once after?? 
2 CONT
2 CONT Death*	after 1662	
2 CONT *Constant died after 1662. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Family 1	 	John Fobes b. 1601, d. 1660/61
2 CONT
