2 CONT Death: 	1731 - Bridgewater, Plymouth County, Massachusetts, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Edward was a deacon and took an active part in public service, serving often as a juror and elected to several terms as Bridgewater's representative to the General Court of Massachusetts. He owned and operated a sawmill. 
