1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Albrekt Hansson Svinhufvud=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Son of Hans Persson, till Surarve and Anna Månsdotter (Svinhufvud)
2 CONT * Albrekt Hansson (Svinhuvud) was a district governor in Aspeboda Sweden.
2 CONT * Son of Hans Persson, till Surarve and Anna Månsdotter (Svinhufvud)
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT {{https://www.geni.com/media/proxy?media_id= 6000000220251928922&size=large}}
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Albrecht Hansson settled on the Barkarbacken farm in Aspeboda. In 1591 he took up the position of county judge in Dalarna and then held this position for almost 34 years. The court records testify to his justice and loyalty to dut
2 CONC y, and he is also mentioned with great respect by the 18th-century dean of Stora Tuna, Magnus Abr. Sahlstedt.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1618, Albrecht and his wife Bengta Nilsdotter of the Hästhuvudsläkten donated a beautiful medieval Lübeck altarpiece to Aspeboda church and had their coats of arms painted – a pig’s head and a horse’s head – on its plinth. They
2 CONC  also donated the majority of two church bells, one of which bears their coat of arms engraved. Albrecht and Bengta had no fewer than 11 children, all of whom were provided with a farm in the area. From them descend all the living
2 CONC  branches of the Svinhufvud family that still exist in Aspeboda (about 160 people) as well as thousands of other descendants spread throughout Sweden.
2 CONT
2 CONT County judge (later county governor) in Dalarna
2 CONT
2 CONT Appointed as judge in 1591 and held his office with great loyalty for almost 34 years and under four kings
2 CONT
2 CONT 11 children
2 CONT
2 CONT Over time, he became a powerful and wealthy man. Together with his wife, he donated an altar cabinet to Aspeboda church and the merpaten of two church bells, one of which is believed to be-
2 CONT
2 CONT Given 50 rdr copper coins according to his will to Kopparbegs church
2 CONT
2 CONT Buried in Aspeboda church inside gravestone
2 CONT
2 CONT MyHeritage family tree Birth: 1550 - Aspeboda, Dalarna County, Sweden Death: 4 Dec 1631 - Aspeboda, Dalarna County, Sweden Parents: Hans Svinhufvud Af Qvalstad, Anna Svinhufvud Af Qvalstad (born Månsdotter) Siblings: ...tan, Marga
2 CONC reta Persson (Halv Hjort) (born Hansdotter Svinhufvud Av Qvalstad), Lasse Hansson Svinhufvud, Unknown Jeppesson, Unknown Jeppesson,... Wife: Bengta Hansson Svinhufud (born Nilsdotter Hästhufvud) Children: ...tsson (born Albrechtsd
2 CONC otter Svinhufvud), Margaretha Albrechtsdotter Svinhufud, Agneta Albrechtsdotter Svinhufud, Johan Albrechtsson Svinhufud...
2 CONT
