2 CONT
2 CONT *Andrew Stewart, 2nd Lord Ochiltree married Agnes Cunningham of the Caprington family. Their children, and grandchildren included:
2 CONT ** Andrew Stewart, known as the Master of Ochiltree (d. 1578). He married Margaret Stewart (d. 1627), daughter of Henry Stewart, 1st Lord Methven, who was known as the Mistress of Ochiltree, and was a member of the households of A
2 CONC nne of Denmark and Prince Henry. Their children included;
2 CONT *** Anne Stewart, who married Andrew Kerr, Lord of Jedburgh.
2 CONT
