2 CONT == Death ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Jean Stewart, here treated, is reported to have died on 16 August 1605, at Stilton in Cambridgeshire, England. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jean_Stewart,_Lady_Bargany Wikipedia]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Marriage ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Jean Stewart, here treated, married https://www.geni.com/people/Gilbert-Kennedy-of-Bargany-and-Ardstinchar/6000000219808251839?through=6000000008027616685. They were contracted on 6 January 1596. [https://www.stirnet.com/genie/
2 CONC data/british/kk/kennedy03.php Stirnet: Kennedy 03] She is noticed as Gilbert's widow on 25 March 1602. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD109%2f2939&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=gilbert+
2 CONC Kennedy+of+Bargany&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=1475&dt=&di=n NRS: GD109/2939]'''
