1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Elizabeth is daughter of Rev.John Knox's 2nd marriage to Margaret Stewart ... the first marriage to Marjory Bowes yielded 2 sons (no descendants), 2nd marriage 3 daughters (many descendants).
