2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT The Children Of Rev. John Welch of Ayr and his wife Elizabeth Knox were:
2 CONT
2 CONT #William,Who Studied Medicine And Was Accidentally Killed In The Netherlands.He Left One Daughter,Who Died Single(1633).
2 CONT #Nathaniel,A Minor At His Mothers Death,in 1625 Was Lost At Sea.The Ship Was Wrecked On One Of The Barren Coast Islands.His Body Was Afterwards Found In The Attitude Of Prayer Where He Had Starved To Death After Having Reached The
2 CONC  Shore. [No known offspring.]
2 CONT #A Daughter,Who Died In 1614 In France While A Child.
2 CONT #Rev.Josias Welch, Of Temple Patrick.
2 CONT #Louise,Born In Jonsac,France,1613,Where Her Father Was Many Years In Exile.She Died Unwed.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.genealogy.com/forum/surnames/topics/welch/4416/
