1 CONT 1- 18 Aug 1993: Data is from the records of Owen B Anderson.
1 CONT 2- I have found out that the name SMALAND is the name of a provence
1 CONT in the center portion of Sweden which comprises the counties of Kalmar,
1 CONT Jonkoping, and Kronoberg. The use of this name does not point to a parish     or county and the first place name is generaly a farm or village within       the parish.
