0 @N6000000002577032562@ NOTE !NOTES:
1 CONT 1- 18 Aug 1993: Data is from the records of Owen B Anderson.
1 CONT 2- I have found out that the name SMALAND is the name of a province
1 CONT in the center portion of Sweden which comprises the counties of Kalmar,
1 CONT Jonkoping, and Kronoberg. The use of this name does not point to a parish or
1 CONT county and the first place name is generaly a farm or village within the
1 CONT parish.
1 CONT 3- A note says that this person is from a family of nobility
0 @N6000000002577032554@ NOTE !NOTES:
1 CONT 1- 18 Aug 1993: Data is from the records of Owen B Anderson.
1 CONT 2- I have found out that the name SMALAND is the name of a province
1 CONT in the center portion of Sweden which comprises the counties of Kalmar,
1 CONT Jonkoping, and Kronoberg. The use of this name does not point to a parish or
1 CONT county and the first place name is generaly a farm or village within the
1 CONT parish.
1 CONT 3- This FGR has this person with a surname of Castanie. The FGR where she is
1 CONT shown with Carl Henrie's parents her surname is shown as von Castle.
